cache:query:What is agriculture?
$440
Agriculture is the cultivation of plants and the working of the soil to produce crops and fruit, often involving tilling the earth. The text notes that before any man existed â€œthere was not a man to till the earthâ€ and that God commanded the earth â€œto bring forth green herbâ€¦ and the fruit tree yielding fruitâ€ã€chunkâ€‘18ã€‘. This describes the basic activity of planting and caring for crops, which is what agriculture entails.
