response
$532
["{\"lc\": 1, \"type\": \"constructor\", \"id\": [\"langchain\", \"schema\", \"output\", \"Generation\"], \"kwargs\": {\"text\": \"Yes. The text states that Adam was created as a man in the likeness of God and was the first human.  \\n- He was \\u201cmade him to the likeness of God\\u201d and \\u201ccalled their name Adam\\u201d in the day when they were created\\u3010chunk-55\\u3011.  \\n- Adam is referred to as a man in Genesis 4 and elsewhere when discussing his lineage\\u3010chunk-41\\u3011.\", \"type\": \"Generation\"}}"]
