["{\"lc\": 1, \"type\": \"constructor\", \"id\": [\"langchain\", \"schema\", \"output\", \"Generation\"], \"kwargs\": {\"text\": \"**Fourth\\u2011day events**\\n\\n| What God did | Description | Source |\\n|--------------|-------------|--------|\\n| Created the firmament\\u2019s lights | He set the great lights in the firmament of heaven to shine on the earth, to rule day and night, and to divide light from darkness. The evening and morning of this day were the fourth day. | [chunk-8] |\\n| (Alternate wording) | \\u201cOn the fourth day he ordered and distributed this light, and made the sun, moon, and stars.\\u201d | [chunk-7] |\\n\\nSo, on the fourth day God arranged the celestial lights\\u2014sun, moon, and stars\\u2014to govern day and night and divided light from darkness.\", \"type\": \"Generation\"}}"]
